[{"path":"README.md","fileType":"docs","lines":[{"lineNumber":1,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"[![Java CI](https://github.com/AY2526S2-CS2103T-T16-2/tp/actions/workflows/gradle.yml/badge.svg?branch\u003dmaster)](https://github.com/AY2526S2-CS2103T-T16-2/tp/actions/workflows/gradle.yml)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":2,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"![Ui](docs/images/Ui.png)","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":3,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":4,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"# IOU – Simple Debt Tracking for Friends and Colleagues ","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":5,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":6,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"IOU is a desktop application designed to help users track small debts and loans among friends, colleagues, or roommates. It allows users to quickly record who owes whom, how much money is involved, and whether the transaction has been settled. The application is optimized for users who prefer typing commands to perform actions quickly while still benefiting from a graphical user interface to view their records.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":7,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":8,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"This project is based on the AddressBook-Level3 project created by the [SE-EDU initiative](https://se-education.org), which provides a robust command-based interface and persistent storage system. IOU adapts this structure to support financial tracking between individuals.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":9,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":10,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":11,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":12,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"## Features","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":13,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":14,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### Add Person","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":15,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **Add Person** feature allows users to create a profile for a friend or colleague so that debts and loans can be associated with them.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Command format:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"add n/NAME [p/PHONE] [e/EMAIL]","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Example:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"add n/Alex Lim p/91234567","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The name must contain only alphanumeric characters and spaces and cannot be blank. Leading and trailing spaces are automatically removed, and multiple internal spaces are treated as a single space. The system checks for duplicate names in a case-insensitive manner to prevent confusion when recording debts. If a duplicate name already exists, the system will reject the command.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"If the command is successful, the application will display the message:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"“New person added: Alex Lim.”","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Errors may occur if the name field is missing, blank, contains special characters, or if multiple name values are provided. Optional phone and email fields follow the standard validation rules from the base application.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":33,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### Add Debt (owe)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":34,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":35,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **Add Debt** feature records money that the user owes to a specific person.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":36,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":37,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Command format:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":38,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`owe INDEX a/AMOUNT [d/DESCRIPTION]`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":39,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":40,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Example:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":41,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`owe 1 a/12.50 d/Dinner at Fish Market`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":42,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":43,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The index refers to the person’s position in the current list displayed in the application. It must be a positive integer and must correspond to a valid person in the list. The amount must be a positive decimal value greater than zero and may contain up to two decimal places. Currency symbols are not allowed.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":44,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":45,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Multiple debts to the same person are allowed because users may owe money for different occasions such as meals, shared transport, or tickets.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":46,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":47,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"If successful, the application displays","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":48,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":49,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"“Added debt of $12.50 to Alex Lim.”","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":50,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":51,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":52,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Possible errors include invalid indices, missing prefixes such as a/, negative or zero amounts, currency symbols in the amount field, or values exceeding two decimal places.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":53,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":54,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":55,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":56,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### Add Loan (lent)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":57,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":58,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **Add Loan** feature records money that another person owes to the user.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":59,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":60,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Command format:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":61,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`lent INDEX a/AMOUNT [d/DESCRIPTION]`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":62,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":63,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Example:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":64,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`lent 2 a/50 d/Borrowed for concert tickets`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":65,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":66,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The validation rules for this command are identical to the **owe** command. The index must refer to a valid person in the list, and the amount must be a positive number with up to two decimal places.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":67,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":68,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Multiple loan entries for the same person are allowed to capture separate transactions.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":69,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":70,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"If successful, the system displays:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":71,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":72,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"“Recorded loan of $50.00 to Sarah Tan.”","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":73,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":74,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":75,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Errors may occur if the index is invalid, if the amount is negative or zero, if the command syntax is incorrect, or if required prefixes are missing.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":76,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":77,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":78,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":79,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### List Outstanding","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":80,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":81,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **List Outstanding** command displays only the people who currently have non-zero balances, meaning either you owe them money or they owe you money.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":82,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":83,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Command format:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":84,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`list`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":85,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":86,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"This command helps reduce clutter in the interface by hiding individuals whose balances are already settled.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":87,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":88,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"If the command is successful, the system displays:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":89,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":90,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"“Listed all people with outstanding balances.”","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":91,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":92,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":93,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"If no outstanding balances exist, the system will show the message:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":94,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":95,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"“No outstanding balances found. You\u0027re all caught up.”","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":96,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":97,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":98,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"An error will occur if additional parameters are provided, since the command does not accept arguments.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":99,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":100,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":101,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":102,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### Settle Transaction","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":103,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":104,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **Settle Transaction** feature allows users to mark a specific debt or loan as settled without deleting the record from the system. This preserves transaction history while ensuring the balance is updated.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":105,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":106,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Command format:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":107,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`settle PERSON_INDEX t/TRANSACTION_INDEX`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":108,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":109,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Example:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":110,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`settle 1 t/2`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":111,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":112,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The person index identifies the individual in the main list, while the transaction index refers to the specific transaction within that person\u0027s transaction history.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":113,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":114,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Once a transaction is settled, its status is updated in the interface and the person’s overall balance is recalculated.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":115,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":116,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Errors may occur if either index is invalid, if the transaction does not exist, if the command format is incorrect, or if the user attempts to settle a transaction that has already been settled.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":117,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":118,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"---","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":119,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":120,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"### Delete Entry","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":121,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":122,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"The **Delete Entry** command allows users to remove either a person or a specific transaction from the records.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":123,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":124,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"To delete a person:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":125,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`delete INDEX`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":126,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":127,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"Example:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":128,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},"content":"`delete 3`","lastModifiedDate":"2026-03-07T16:05:02","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":129,"author":{"gitId":"SirFirelordPanda"},